    <string name="action_record_on_watch">Record on watch</string>
    <string name="about_use_title">What Heartline is for</string>
    <string name="about_use_body">Heartline records a single-lead ECG, estimates blood pressure after cuff calibration, and checks your heart rhythm in the background with a Galaxy Watch. It\'s for general wellness and to help you talk with your doctor.</string>
    <string name="about_disclaimer_body">Heartline isn\'t a medical device. It can\'t diagnose, treat or rule out any condition, and it can\'t detect heart attacks, blood clots or stroke. Don\'t change your medication or treatment based on it. If you think you\'re having a medical emergency, call emergency services.</string>
    <string name="about_privacy_title">Your data</string>
    <string name="about_privacy_body">Measurements stay on your watch and phone. Nothing is uploaded; you choose when to share a PDF or export a CSV.</string>
